  "sampleSummary": "You may care about doing things well and having your ideas recognized. State your main point clearly, then leave room for cooperation.",
  "sampleTrait1Title": "You want a voice of your own",
  "sampleTrait1Text": "The example Sun in Leo offers a way to discuss expression and creativity. When a subject feels familiar, you may want to suggest a plan first. If it is not chosen, asking why can help more than rushing to prove yourself.",
  "sampleTrait2Title": "Balance freedom with responsibility",
  "sampleTrait2Text": "The example Moon's exploratory themes and the Sun–Saturn connection can prompt reflection on freedom and duty. Set aside clear rest time and write down commitments, giving both needs a place.",
  "sampleWatch1Title": "Different opinions need not reject you",
  "sampleWatch1Text": "When someone changes a plan or has not replied, check whether they question the method or the goal. Notice rushed explanations, interruptions, or repeated message checking. Ask, “Which part concerns you most?” before agreeing on what to change.",
  "sampleWatch2Title": "Leave room before making commitments",
  "sampleWatch2Text": "Wanting recognition can lead to accepting more than your time allows. Check your calendar, the effort involved, and existing commitments before answering. If unsure, say, “Let me check my schedule and get back to you tomorrow.”",
  "sampleAdvice1Title": "Prepare three sentences for a conversation",
  "sampleAdvice1Text": "Write the observable fact, your need, and one specific request. For example: “The plan changed twice this week. I need to confirm the direction. Could we use ten minutes to agree on priorities?” Pause for their response and record the agreement.",
  "sampleAdvice2Title": "Turn one goal into an action for today",
  "sampleAdvice2Text": "Choose one goal. List what you need, the first action, and how to check it. Spend twenty minutes on a small step, such as gathering three pieces of feedback or drafting an email. Check that step before choosing the next.",
  "sampleAdvice3Title": "Make room for a short weekly review",
  "sampleAdvice3Text": "At a regular time, record one useful experience, one difficult conversation, and one adjustment to try. Use actual events to see whether the advice fits. Leave aside or change approaches that do not help.",
